{{Documentation/Header}}
Displays a notice that a page is protected and editable only by administrators, and files it under [[:Category:Protected Pages]]. Place it at the top of the protected page.

==Syntax==
{{T|Admin Only|v1=nocat =}}

==Examples==
{{T|Admin Only|_Y_=1|p1=nocat = true}}

